# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in for local testing against a real backend. Not committed
# (repo root .gitignore excludes `.env`/`.env.*`, keeping this example alive). Unset =
# `runState.ts`'s DEFAULT_MATCH_BASE_URL (http://localhost:8788) — the local three-process
# dev setup needs no configuration at all.

# matchsvc's public origin (server/deploy/README.md). The deployed build reads this from the
# repo Variable MATCHSVC_URL, injected by .github/workflows/client-deploy.yml — this file is
# only for a local build that wants to talk to that same real backend instead of localhost.
# VITE_MATCHSVC_URL=https://bb.gamestao.com
